{"version":1,"content":"<p>藝人梁祖堯、王菀之、盧振業及谷祖琳等今日（23日）出席晚上公演的舞台劇《寫不得你》拜神儀式，祈求演出順利。</p><p>談到《寫》劇由15場加到21場，梁祖堯坦言在現時經濟環境下，跟入場看電影相比，欣賞舞台劇對普羅大眾來說算是奢侈的活動，感恩觀眾支持，王</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T08:04:02.885241+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T07:09:29+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T07:58:15.376397+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T07:58:15.376397+00:00","content_hash":"136d9250e38570972b62037b03e8f6875bbe29065c1f1f32b09f4f4d95bcf44e","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}